<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Product Listing</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Mobile Phone Store</h1>

    <img src="phone.jpg" alt="Mobile phone" width="200">

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>High-resolution display</li>
        <li>Long-lasting battery</li>
        <li>Fast processor</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Product Details</h2>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="8">
        <tr>
            <th>Product</th>
            <th>Price</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Smartphone A</td>
            <td>₹15,000</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Smartphone B</td>
            <td>₹20,000</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
Example HTTP request
GET /products.html HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Accept: text/html
Example HTTP response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/html

<html>
<body>
<h1>Mobile Phone Store</h1>
</body>
</html>
Common HTTP status codes
Status code	Meaning
200	OK
301	Moved Permanently
400	Bad Request
403	Forbidden
404	Not Found
500	Internal Server Error
